        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Wageningen</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Wageningen, a municipality in Gelderland, issued emergency paper money of 1 and 2½ guilders during the First World War, dated 10 August 1914. Furthermore, the brick factory "Over-Betuwe" is said to have issued a 2½ guilder note dated 8 August 1914.</skos:definition>
        <dcterms:source rdf:resource="https://wiki.muntenenpapiergeld.nl/index.php?title=Papiergeldplaatsen"/>
